vices** — Finance Committee approves acquiring a loan portfolio of up to **Rs 7.00 crore** from KLM Axiva Finvest in one or more tranches, at arm's length.","**Indian Hotels / Oriental Hotels** — a Scheme of Arrangement between Oriental Hotels and The Indian Hotels Company is filed with the exchanges by both parties.","**KP Group** — KPI Green Energy, K.P. Energy and KP Green Engineering each file a **non-binding Letter of Intent with Raz Holding Group** for a proposed strategic investment or collaboration.","**Dabur India** — the NCLT New Delhi Bench reserves its order on the second motion petition.","**Tata Consultancy Services** — announces a partnership with **Porsche AG** on AI-powered mobility.","**LEAP India** — incorporates a new step-down subsidiary, LEAP Pallet Pooling Trading L.L.C.","**Gujarat Inject Kerala** — announces that it has entered into a Strategic Business Partnership Agreement."],"capex_core":["**Aegis Vopak Terminals** — subsidiary Aegis Terminal (Pipavav) **acquires** a 36,000 MT ammonia storage terminal at Pipavav from promoter Aegis Logistics for **Rs 525.00 crore**, a related-party slump sale at arm's length _(~1.7% of mcap)_.","**Fujiyama Power Systems** — enhancement of lithium-battery manufacturing capacity by **1 GWh** at the Ratlam plant, Madhya Pradesh.","**Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers** — announces capacity expansion through **three new facilities**."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — **19 companies filed** results or earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Smartworks Coworking Spaces** — announces about **Rs 235 crore of incremental contracted rental revenue** driven by enterprise expansions.","**Blue Cloud Softech Solutions** — says it has commenced execution of a **USD 150 million master services agreement** with SpaceX International Ltd, Malaysia.","**IZMO** — business update release carrying a **Rs 65.38 crore**